WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:07.650
I'm the only visitor Uranus and Neptune have ever had.

2
00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:15.210
In 2023 someone on Earth accidentally pointed my antenna two degrees away from home.

3
00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:18.890
For two weeks I couldn't hear a thing.

4
00:00:19.590 --> 00:00:25.410
Then a big antenna in Australia ‘shouted’ a command to me — and I turned back.

5
00:00:26.110 --> 00:00:30.960
Uranus and Neptune have had only one visitor. Me.
